      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Eastern Wastes [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Yealdin Stormfell [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Insignia of the Storm Boar [item=137729]\n- Terse Note [item=137727]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a storm boar soldier [npc=55595]\n- a wandering corpse [npc=55594]\n- an undying dire wolf [npc=55596]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of The Eastern Wastes (10 Points) [quest=9795]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Oct 24 20:51:44 2019\nModified: Thu Jan 15 02:07:49 2026 | | **Torment of Velious Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nYou can get this shared task from Yealdin Stormfell in The Eastern Wastes in the southeastern corner of the zone at -2394, -2373, -1, he is on the find tool (CTRL F).\nTip: If you failed a step, everyone in the group needs to go back to Yealdin and hail him and say \"Try Again\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Yealdin Stormfell'\nYealdin Stormfell says, 'If you have come to threaten me there is no need. I have sworn to protect this place in exchange for refuge. The coldain have accepted my oath, as they should, and allow me to remain. As much as I might prefer to be out [seeking] my warband, I must remain here.'\nYou say, 'seeking'\nYealdin Stormfell says, 'I was separated from my soldiers when a horde of undead Ry'Gorr assaulted our fortress. I managed to fight my way out and was pursued here by a small group of monsters. In times like these it seems that even the oldest enemies must assist each other. The coldain aided me in defeating them and I have been here since. I am certain that my soldiers have held their posts and I would like to [assist them].'\nYou say, 'assist them'\nYealdin Stormfell says, 'It seems that if the coldain and I can remain civil under the circumstances, perhaps I can trust you to aid me and go to the fort and assist my war band. We living must band together if we are to survive. If you can [aid] my soldiers and return them here, we will be better able to guard this place, which is important for all of us.'\nYou say, 'aid'\nYealdin Stormfell says, 'A reasonable decision. Go to the fortress and provide some assistance and certainly my soldiers will be able to escape.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Last of the Storm Boars'.\n\n---\n\n_Yealdin Stormfell has dedicated himself to defending the coldain wall until whatever is causing the upheaval here. However, he was forced to leave some companions in the giant fortress and is now worried about them. He has asked you to see if you can find them and bring them here._\n_Head to the giant fort. Yealdin believes that his soldiers are still defending the fortress. He wants you to talk to them and bring them to him._\n1\\. Go to the giant fort and find where the Storm Boars are. 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\n_An enormous restless dead orc leaps into the room and attacks._\nHead to the building on the south and just inside, \"a wandering corpse\" (orc style monster) will spawn. Kill for task update.\nYour task 'The Last of the Storm Boars' has been updated.\n2\\. Find a clue about where the Storm Boars have gone 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nLoot the _Terse Note_ from the just-slain orc.\nYour task 'The Last of the Storm Boars' has been updated.\n3\\. Head to the great bridge 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nHead east--just north of the Crystal Caverns zone line--towards the two Coldain huts.\n_Around location: 382, -1757, -25_, 3x \"A wandering corpse\" will spawn.\nYour task 'The Last of the Storm Boars' has been updated.\n4\\. Defeat the undead orcs 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nKill the three undead orcs that spawned.\nYour task 'The Last of the Storm Boars' has been updated.\n5\\. Pick up the insignia ring as it surely indicates that the Storm Boars came this way 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nLoot an _Insignia of the Storm Boar_ from a wandering corpse's corpse.\n6\\. Find the lost Storm Boars somewhere near the great bridge 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\n3 wolves and 2 giants will spawn under the south side of the bridge.\nKill the 3 wolves then go to the spot on the bridge at /way -153, -2462, 44\n7\\. Defeat the undead dire wolves surrounding the Storm Boars 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nKill the 3 wolves. The wolves can be singled pull without aggroing one another.\nThis will update after you go to the spot on the bridge.\nYour task 'The Last of the Storm Boars' has been updated.\n8\\. Defeat the Storm Boars and gather proof that you found them 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nKill the 2 giants.\nLoot an _Insignia of the Storm Boar_ from a storm boar soldier's corpse.\nYour task 'The Last of the Storm Boars' has been updated.\n9\\. Deliver 1 Terse Note to Yealdin 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nYealdin Stormfell says, 'Their plan makes some tactical sense, as expected. Did you eventually find them?'\nYour task 'The Last of the Storm Boars' has been updated.\n10\\. Deliver 2 Insignia of the Storm Boar to Yealdin 0/2 (The Eastern Wastes)\nYealdin Stormfell says, 'Please, tell me what happened to my soldiers. It is important to me to know what their fate was.'\nYour task 'The Last of the Storm Boars' has been updated.\n11\\. Tell Yealdin what happened to his soldiers 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nYou say, 'The soldiers are dead.'\nYealdin Stormfell hardens his face, 'There was nothing to be done if they were already dead. Certainly they died a worthy death with many corpses piled around them. I thank you for this information.'\nYour task 'The Last of the Storm Boars' has been updated.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nYou receive 425 platinum.\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 425 platinum",
