      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Eastern Wastes [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Iceweaver Sjeon [ _Raids and Mission_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Expedition\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Kael Drakkel [ToV]: Icebound Avatar\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Icebound Avatar of War [npc=55604]\n- a minion of Sullon [npc=55613]\n- a minion of Vallon [npc=55614]\n- a restless guardian of Zek [npc=55615]\n- a restless spectator [npc=55617]\n- an animated axe [npc=55616]\n- an icebound chest [npc=55603]\n**Related Quests:**\n- All Credit to Rallos (10 Points) [quest=9907]\n- Bend the Knee (Group) (10 Points) [quest=9908]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Oct 24 22:35:46 2019\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | This group mission starts out with Iceweaver Sjeon outside of Kael in The Eastern Wastes at -1359, +2106, +5.\nYou say, 'Hail, Iceweaver Sjeon'\nIceweaver Sjeon says, 'Hello, tiny one. You may just be the creature I need to speak with. King Tormax ordered me to leave Kael and seek [assistance].'\nYou say, 'assistance'\nIceweaver Sjeon says, 'It is to our shame that we need assistance, but the truth cannot be denied. Our city is being overrun by these,' he pauses, seeking the words he needs and failing to find them. 'This horrible magic is claiming our fallen kin. It is hard for us to strike them. We revere our fallen and seeing them walking again has cause some to hesitate. That hesitation has cost many lives. I would beg you to come and speak with our King. He wishes to speak with some of the so-called heroes of Norrath. You look like one of those. [Will] you come with me?'\nYou say, 'Will'\nIceweaver Sjeon says, 'Good. In order to teleport you into the keep I must know if you plan to bring a [large] or [small] host.'\nYou say, 'small'\nIceweaver Sjeon says, 'I can send you to see King Tormax in when you are [ready].'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Icebound Avatar'.\n\n---\n\n_King Tormax is in need of help. The king's ability to defend against the undead giants was dramatically reduced when the icebound avatar of war destroyed the protective magical barrier. Tormax is extremely concerned that the statue to his god, the one that has been inhabited by an avatar of that same god, has been animated by this strange restless ice. He would like you to stop the statue, even if it means destroying it._\nDefeat the Icebound Avatar of War. 0/1 Kael Drakkel\nThe Avatar is in the Arena. Hail him to trigger the event.\nAt various points, he will emote \" **Avatar of War shouts that \\_\\_\\_ must bend the knee**\". That player has to duck or he will die. The player can stand once the Avatar emotes, 'The Avatar of War nods, accepting the subservience of those that gave it.'\nAt 60% the Avatar teleports to the north room.\nThe Avatar of War changes the rules and chooses a new field of battle!\nWith his soldiers defeated, it is now possible to defeat the Avatar.\nAdds keep spawning, kill them and get the Avatar down.\nOpen the chest and claim your reward 0/1 Kael Drakkel\nOpen an icebound chest [npc=55603].\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n283 platinum 3 gold 3 silver 3 copper\nYou gain experience!\n23 Froststone Ducats\n\n---\n\nKeal Mission - ToV - 3 Cheeve - YouTube\nTap to unmute\nKeal Mission - ToV - 3 Cheeve bronut norotaku\nbronut norotaku41 subscribers\nWatch on\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Froststone Ducat [item=137538]",
    },
