      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Eastern Wastes [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Reclamation Officer Borminn [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Quest Items:**\n- Restless Coldain Essence [item=137906]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a restless Coldain [npc=54974]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of The Eastern Wastes (10 Points) [quest=9794]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Nov 10 04:35:49 2019\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Torment of Velious Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nTo get this task, speak with Reclamation Officer Borminn (CTRL F) in the coldain camp in the far southwest corner of Eastern Wastes.\nYou say, 'Hail, Reclamation Officer Borminn'\nReclamation Officer Borminn says, 'Finally, it's good to see someone here who can [fight] as hard as one of us. I'm not going to sweeten this story, the wastes are looking more grim than usual, and the living are going to need all of the help we can get. I'm the reclamation officer of this camp. It's nice to meet you, but we will have to eschew the normal pleasantries, as we have bigger issues happening at the moment. I hope you brought a source of heat because it's going to be a long night.'\nYou say, 'fight'\nReclamation Officer Borminn says, 'You may have noticed that we are up to our necks in denizens who refused to journey to the plane of their gods. Because of this, we need to find strong willed individuals such as yourself to take up the mantle and assist the living with culling the ranks of the [undead]. We are not sure what is going on around here, but we are pretty sure it has something to do with that accursed tower.'\nYou say, ' What can I do about the undead?'\nReclamation Officer Borminn says, 'We need to reduce the numbers of undead in the Eastern Wastes, but these undead are far more tenacious than ones we have encountered before. The only thing any of us can guess is that something happening an that cursed tower is causing them to become harder to kill... again. While they become only mildly inconvenienced when we destroy their physical form, we can make lasting change by destroying what is [fueling] their return.'\nYou say, ' What do you mean by 'fueling'?'\nReclamation Officer Borminn says, 'Each monster we must face will require a different method of destruction. Some must have their [essence] removed and obliterated by special magics, some need to have their frozen [hearts] shattered. I have associates with the ability to destroy these things, but first we must acquire them.'\nYou say, 'essence'\nReclamation Officer Borminn says, 'Collecting these will be no small feat. if you manage to destroy any [banshees] or [coldain], you may be able to collect what remains of their spirit from the bodies. Now, some of the recently turned coldains or banshees won't have enough essence to gather, which is a good thing as I see it. This means we won't have to worry about them coming back to bother us anymore.'\nYou say, ' The coldain are corrupted?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Stubborn, Even in Death'.\nReclamation Officer Borminn grumbles expletives under his breath 'I was afraid you would ask about them. Look, we coldain are stubborn while they are alive, but it seems that the restless ice has made them even more stubborn in death. We have sent out scouting parties, but they failed to return. If on your adventures you happen to run into any, kill their husks and bring me their essences. I will contact my friends to be sure that the spirits are properly destroyed.'\n\n---\n\n_The coldain hunting parties that were sent to scout the Eastern Wastes failed to return. Upon further reconnaissance, it was discovered that they too have been lost to the restless ice. In order to ensure their final death, they need to be killed and their essences taken in order to be destroyed. Reclamation Officer Borminn has contacts that can assist with this, but you are being asked to bring the essences of the fallen back to him so that he can free them._\n01. Kill Restless Coldains and collect their essences. 0/6 (The Eastern Wastes)\n\n\n\nSeek out Restless Coldains, they are plentyfull towards the Ry`Gorr Mines/Crystal Caverns zone-line area and kill them to collect their essences.\n\n\n\n\nYour task 'Stubborn, Even in Death' has been updated.\n05. Deliver Restless Coldain Essences to Reclamation Officer Borminn 0/6 (The Eastern Wastes)\n\n\n\nReturn to Borminn and turn-in the looted essences for task update.\n\n\n\n\nYour task 'Stubborn, Even in Death' has been updated.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n106 Platinum, 2 Gold, 5 Silver\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 106 Platinum, 2 Gold, 5 Silver",
    },
