      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Eastern Wastes [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Grunak [ _Ry'gorr Refugee_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Orctooth [item=138530]\n- Ry`Gorr Blessed Sack [item=137701]\n- Ry`Gorr Blessed Torch [item=137724]\n- Ry`Gorr Tooth Necklace [item=137700]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Orctooth [npc=54992]\n- Restless Ry`Gorr [npc=55344]\n- Ry`Gorr Corpse [npc=55345]\n- an infected orc [npc=55356]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of The Eastern Wastes (10 Points) [quest=9795]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 3 21:01:50 2019\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Torment of Velious Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\nIf you don't know the Orchish language, just say \"Orctooth\" to Grunak to get the quest.\nYou say, 'Hail, Grunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee'\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee stares longingly into the fire, eventually looking up and catching your gaze. His eyes appear to be welling over, which is unusual for an orc but you get the feeling this is not an ordinary orc you're dealing with. 'You, Half Elf, come closer. Need [help].\nYou say, 'help'\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee says, in Orcish, 'Lost Orctooth. You find Orctooth. Orctooth not here anymore. Maybe [guards] know where.'\nYou say, 'guards'\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee says, in Orcish, 'Guard take prisoner. No can look for Orctooth. Say too dangerous. Say need to be watched. Have nothing. All gone. I stay [here]. You go find Orctooth.'\nYou say, ' Why are you here?'\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee says, in Orcish, 'Left home after ice attack. Am prisoner. Oracles and mystics no help. Nothing left home. This better than home. Need new home. Ry`Gorr clan out there, somewhere. No other orcs here. Ask guard. Maybe [Orctooth] know where Ry`Gorr gone.'\nYou say, 'Orctooth'\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee says, in Orcish, 'Orctooth missing. Need to find Orctooth. Ask where Orctooth is. Might know.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'You Can't Go Back Home'.\n\n---\n\n1\\.  Ask the guards if they have seen a kitten named Orctooth 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nSay _**orctooth**_ to a Coldain reclaimer in the same vicinity as Grunak. You may have to speak to multiple NPCs until you receive the update.\nYou say, 'Hail, a Coldain reclaimer'\nA Coldain reclaimer says, 'Hello there, Half Elf. Have ye come to join the reclamation efforts? We can certainly use someone with your skillset to help us with that endeavor. Why don't ye take a moment and talk to the Reclamation Officer over there? He'll likely be needing your help.'\nYou say, 'orctooth'\nA Coldain reclaimer says, 'Aye, now that you mention it, I did hear a scout say that they spotted a wee kitty to the northwest at the abandoned ruins. If you still think the cat is alive and you want to find them, then good luck, my friend. You're braver than I.'\nYour task 'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated.\n2\\. Return to Grunak and inform them of what you learned 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nYou say, 'Hail, Grunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee'\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee says, 'Dwarf see Orctooth? You find! Go to Ry`Gorr home, bring me Orctooth.'\nYour task 'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated.\nYou have been given: Ry`Gorr Blessed Sack\nYour task 'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated.\n3\\. Search for Orctooth at the ruins to the northwest of the Coldain camp 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nHead to the fort with the entrance to Ry`Gorr Mines. Orctooth (a small black cat), will be moving pearched on a broken tree or circling the for ruins.\nRight-click the Sack on it.\nOrctooth reluctantly gets inside the sack, but you hear a terrifying growling sound that's getting louder.\nYour task 'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated.\n4\\. Defend yourself from the restless Ry`Gorr 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nRestless Ry`Gorr says, 'Freeeee uuuuuussss...'\nAn orc will spawn: _Restless Ry`Gorr (level 113)_. Kill the orc for the update (note: this orc has way more HP than standard mobs and hits extremely hard. Be ready for a long fight and for possible pathing mobs).\nYour task 'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated.\n5\\. Recover the necklace from the restless orc 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nLoot a _Ry`Gorr Tooth Necklace_ from the corpse.\nYour task 'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated.\n6\\. Return Orctooth to Grunak 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nReturn to and turn in Orctooth to Grunak.\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee says, 'You find Orctooth! Orctooth safe! Other Ry`Gorr like warg. I like Orctooth. What you holding? Where you find that? I see?\nYour task 'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated\n7\\. Give Grunak the necklace you found 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nTurn the necklace in to Grunak.\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee blinks, allowing for more tears to roll down his cheek. 'This... is clan symbol. Am alone now. Home gone. Clan gone. It just Orctooth and me. Me need time to be alone. Go.'\nAs you turn to leave, the refuge calls you back. 'High Elf, wait. [Clan] need help.'\nYour task 'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated\nYou have been given: Ry`Gorr Blessed Torch\nYou say, 'Clan.'\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee looks north, 'Clan die, but still move. Stop them moving. Take tooths.' He grabs a flaming piece of wood from the fire and uses his nail to scratch some runes into it, 'Here, take fire. Burn them to stop moving again.'\n8\\. Kill infected orcs 0/7 (The Eastern Wastes)\nHead to the center of the zone near the Ry`Gorr Mines zone area and kill orcs.\n9\\. Recover Ry`Gorr Tooth Necklaces 0/7 (The Eastern Wastes)\nLoot 7 _Ry`Gorr Tooth Necklace_ from the orcs just killed. The necklaces can drop in multiple quantities.\n10\\. Burn Ry`Gorr Corpses 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nUse the Ry`Gorr Blessed Torch, right-click it on _Ry`Gorr Corpse_ bodies on the ground around the fort area.\n11\\. Return the Ry`Gorr Necklaces to Grunak 0/7 (The Eastern Wastes)\nReturn to Grunak and hand in the 7 necklaces.\n'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated.\n12\\. Return to Grunak and give him back the torch 0/1 (The Eastern Wastes)\nTurn in the Ry`Gorr Blessed Torch to Grunak.\n'You Can't Go Back Home has been updated.\nGrunak, Ry`Gorr Refugee looks into the fire, tossing what is left of the torch back into it. 'You help, I thank... need to be alone, need to rebuild... Maybe Orctooth keep me happy. Thank you, friend.'\nYour task 'You Can't Go Back Home' has been updated.\nGrunak wishes to be alone for the time being, needing to reflect on the loss of his clan. For now, it seems, you have helped him come to terms with what has happened. He is grateful for your assistance.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Larth\n- You receive 5 gold. You receive 212 platinum.",
