      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Eastern Wastes [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Emli Widgetton [npc=54985]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Velium Shard [item=137795]\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Tower of Frozen Shadow [ToV]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a golem usher [npc=55005]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of The Tower of Frozen Shadow (10 Points) [quest=9801]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 3 22:24:24 2019\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Torment of Velious Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nEmli Widgetton is located at the coldain camp in the southeast corner of The Eastern Wastes.\nUpon completion of the previous task: 'Oh, It's You Again!',\nEmli Widgetton says, 'Well, now that we have the vampire blood, we can move into other tasks that could help with our research. I have been asked to collect pieces that fall off the [ **Velium Golems**]. These pieces can be reforged and turned into armor that can protect our troops from the spectral attacks from the spirits wiithin this accursed tower. We discovered recently that the only way that we can ward off these creatures is by using the velium itself, but only velium that has been imbued with the restless ice.'\nYou say, 'What **velium golems**?'\nEmli Widgetton says, 'This tower holds many denizens but the ones that are most intriguing are the Velium Golems. These golems were already constructed but then came in contact with the restless ice, causing them to morph into something even more terrifying. I was only able to hear reports of these creatures, but when we found a small piece that must have fallen off one of them, it was discovered that the ghosts inside actively try to avoid contact with the material. You will find more of these [ **shards**] inside the tower, but you may need to take down a few of the golems in order to cllect large enough samples for us to use in smithing.'\nYou say, 'What **shards**?'\nEmli Widgetton says, 'Collect about 10 of these shards and that will be enough to create some armor to protect our soldiers from further harm.'\nYou have been assigned the task, 'Restless Mess.'\n\n---\n\n1. Destroy Velium Golems 0/6 The Tower of Frozen Shadow\n\n\n\nEnter the ToFS and slay any six velium golems, mostly on floor 5 for task update.\n\n\n\n\nVelium Shards [item=137795] drop off the golems you are killing, so loot six shards.\n4. Deliver Shards of Velium to Emli Widgetton 0/6 The Eastern Wastes\n\n\n\nDeliver the six looted shards to Emli for task update.\nYour task 'Restless Mess' has been updated.\n_Emli takes the shards you hand her and places them into a pouch she has kept at her side, gently patting it as it settles, saying 'Interesting, the blood seems to freeze as soon as it leaves the body'._\nYou receive 5 gold.\nYou receive 212 platinum.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 platinum 5 gold\n**Submitted by:** Larth",
