      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Eastern Wastes [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Emli Widgetton [npc=54985]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Necromancy Research Notes [item=137832]\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Tower of Frozen Shadow [ToV]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a ghostly scholar [npc=55003]\n- a ghostly student [npc=55004]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Mercenary of The Tower of Frozen Shadow (10 Points) [quest=9801]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 3 22:26:52 2019\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Torment of Velious Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nEmli Widgetton is located at the coldain camp in the southeast corner of The Eastern Wastes.\nSay **study** to request the task.\nEmli Widgetton says, 'The only good thing these monsters did during their time alive was document their work. They are very thorough with their research and it is one of the most impressive things about their school of study. They kept journals, meticulously keeping track of each experiment and how it would help them have a better understanding of the process of life and death. Their work is what keeps them tied to this plane, which is unfortunate. Relieve them of their research and bring the pages of their dedication to me for proper disposal.\n\n---\n\n1. Destroy Ghostly Scholars 0/5 The Tower of Frozen Shadow\n\n\n\nHead to floor 2 and kill ghostly scholars and students for kill update and to loot five Necromancy Research Notes.\n4. Deliver Necromancy Research Notes to Emli Widgetton 0/5 The Eastern Wastes\nUpon handing in the five research notes to Emli:\nYour task, 'This Will Come Back to Haunt Us' has been updated.\n_You get an uneasy feeling that maybe this won't be the last time you see this knowledge._\nYou receive 5 gold.\nYou receive 212 platinum.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 platinum 5 gold\n**Submitted by:** Larth\n- 212 platinum 5 gold",
